00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.740
a month and there are also all
kinds of other goodies and tiers

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:40.650
that you can get involved with.
So everybody, thank you again

00:20:40.680 --> 00:20:42.450
and thank you for your support.

